<title>DENMARK: Den Danske Bank issues $300 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Den Danske Bank issues $300 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Den Danske Bank said on Wednesday it issued a $300 million bond with Deutsche Bank AG, London as lead manager.</p>
</text>
